cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this specification, please cite it as below."
title: "Dutch Marquise: Open Geometry Specification"
abstract: >-
  An open, versioned, machine-readable specification for the Dutch Marquise
  diamond cut and its companion the French Marquise: outline, faceting pattern,
  certificate nomenclature (hexagonal modified brilliant), and how to read the
  length-to-width ratio from a grading report, every claim sourced. Published by
  Stienhardt, New York, which controls this cut through a specialized factory relationship and hand-sets and finishes the stones in New York City.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Stienhardt"
    website: "https://stienhardt.com"
    city: "New York"
    country: "US"
version: "1.0.2"
date-released: "2026-09-02"
license: CC-BY-4.0
